# Jylhis Monochrome Dark (dark) — Ghostty colorscheme
# Drop in ~/.config/ghostty/themes/jylhis-mono-dark and reference with
# `theme = jylhis-mono-dark` in config.
#
# ANSI 0–6 are Modus Vivendi accents so `ls`, `bat`, `delta`, `git log`
# share the editor's palette. ANSI 11 is the brand bronze — intentional
# override so prompts and dir-permissions carry the Jylhis identity.
# See tokens.md §3.

